run_eval: read claude -p output through a thread on Windows

select.select() only accepts sockets on Windows, so every query failed with
WinError 10038. A daemon thread pumps stdout chunks into a queue; the poll
loop and timeout are unchanged.

diff --git a/skills/skill-creator/scripts/run_eval.py b/skills/skill-creator/scripts/run_eval.py
